  <h1>Terms of use and copyright</h1>
  <p class="sommario">What the website offers, how accounts and purchases work and how the content is protected. Last updated: 9 November 2026. This is a translation; the Italian version prevails.</p>

  <h2>Owner of the website</h2>
  <p>The website ripetizionidianalisi.com is run by Carmine Tornincasa, who is also the author and owner of the rights to its content. Contact: <a href="mailto:carminetornincasa98@gmail.com">carminetornincasa98@gmail.com</a>, WhatsApp from the <a href="/en/contatti">Contact</a> page, Instagram <a href="https://instagram.com/ripetizioni_di_analisi_mate" rel="noopener">@ripetizioni_di_analisi_mate</a>.</p>

  <h2>The service</h2>
  <p>The website publishes study material in mathematics and physics: theory, worked exercises and exercises with solutions. Part of the content is free to read; full access to a subject is obtained with a one-time purchase, with no subscription and no renewals.</p>

  <h2>Account and access</h2>
  <p>A free account, created with an email address and a password, is needed to buy a subject. The account is <strong>personal</strong>: it may not be transferred, lent or shared, and the login details must be kept safe. An account can be used on at most three devices. In case of unusual use (for example logins from many devices or by different people) access may be suspended.</p>

  <h2>Purchases</h2>
  <p>Subjects, bundles and prerecorded video courses are sold for a one-time payment for personal study. <a href="https://www.paddle.com" rel="noopener">Paddle</a> is the authorised reseller for these purchases. It collects payment, issues the receipt and applies the VAT due in the buyer’s country. Purchased subjects are unlocked in the buyer’s account after payment. Each video course page explains how to access the recordings.</p>
  <p>Live individual lessons booked on the website are paid for through Stripe. Carmine collects payments directly for live group courses. To find out who to contact and which terms apply, see the <a href="/en/rimborsi">refund policy and right of withdrawal</a>.</p>


