  <p>All content on the website, free and paid, consists of creative works protected by Italian copyright law (Law no. 633 of 22 April 1941) and by international rules. This includes in particular the theory texts, the worked exercises and the exercises with their solutions, the figures and graphs, the PDFs, the selection and order of the topics and the layout of the pages. The name and logo "Ripetizioni di Analisi" identify the service of Carmine Tornincasa.</p>
  <p>All rights are reserved to Carmine Tornincasa. Only <strong>personal</strong> use for study is allowed: reading the content on your own devices and printing one copy for yourself.</p>
  <p>Without written permission it is prohibited, even in part and even free of charge, to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>copy, reproduce or transcribe the content, including by photos or screenshots;</li>
    <li>share or distribute the content, the PDFs or printouts, for example in WhatsApp or Telegram groups, on Google Drive, on social networks or on other websites;</li>
