  <p>Under Article 70-quater of the Italian copyright law, the owner expressly reserves text and data mining of the paid content, including its use to train artificial intelligence systems.</p>

  <h2>Infringements</h2>
  <p>In case of infringement of copyright or of these terms, the account may be deactivated, subject to mandatory consumer rights. The owner may request the removal of the distributed content and take action to protect his rights as provided by law. Anyone who finds content from this website published elsewhere without permission can report it to the contacts above.</p>

  <h2>Pi, the assistant</h2>
  <p>Pi is an assistant based on artificial intelligence that answers study questions. Its answers may contain errors and should be checked; they do not replace the content of the website or the teacher's advice.</p>

  <h2>Limitations</h2>
  <p>The material is prepared carefully and every exercise is checked, but the website does not replace the textbooks adopted by your course and does not guarantee passing exams. Errors can be reported to the contacts above and are corrected.</p>

  <h2>Changes and applicable law</h2>
